&lt;falsescoremode&gt;=&lt;/falsescoremode&gt;&lt;falsescore&gt;0&lt;/falsescore&gt;
The seven authored tests cover another correct integer matrix, a correct fractional matrix, and negative definite, semidefinite, nonsymmetric and indefinite submissions. The checker decides whether the answer satisfies the rule; the PRT branches own credit.
